The test `testBitAndCount` only exercises `andBitCountLong`. Since `andBitCountInt` is the path selected on aarch64 (per the `BIT_COUNT_MH` dispatch in #VKZZW), it would be valuable to add a parallel test:
```java
public void testBitAndCountInt() {
    testBasicBitAndImpl(ESVectorUtil::andBitCountInt);
}
